[{"type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003c@U01AQ5BFNLX\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618552488.149300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"6bc81370-40a8-4f1d-beed-ea0746268817","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"rebase のあと force push する前に\n```git range-diff @{u} HEAD@{1} @```\nで rebase 前との差分をチェックできることを最近知った。","ts":"1618552434.148600","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","reply_count":8,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":4,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U81LLJ340","U9S4G0LJW","U016GRZN0GJ"]},{"name":"hee","count":3,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U06ECBRTJ","U01ASHBSD9V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ivL/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f0ae36d-16ab-43fd-95a9-449670ab4211","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/cli/cli#comparison-with-hub\u003e\n\u0026gt; For many years, \u003chttps://github.com/github/hub|hub\u003e was the unofficial GitHub CLI tool. `gh` is a new project that helps us explore what an official GitHub CLI tool can look like with a fundamentally different design.","ts":"1618541430.146600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: cli/cli","id":1,"title":"cli/cli","title_link":"https://github.com/cli/cli#comparison-with-hub","text":"GitHub’s official command line tool. Contribute to cli/cli development by creating an account on GitHub.","image_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/212613049/d51e7480-f84b-11ea-84d5-4ef1c4d2a5bc","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/cli/cli#comparison-with-hub","original_url":"https://github.com/cli/cli#comparison-with-hub"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jpd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb588756-5fec-4898-a8a3-0f107aa2537d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"おっhubは新しいカードだ。","ts":"1618541392.146300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2M7U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0098af9d-2b22-42df-98d5-03eb682bfd1f","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u0026gt;  本ツールはGitHub公式であるのに対して、\u003chttps://github.com/github/hub|hub\u003eという非公式ツールがあります。\n\u003chttps://dev.classmethod.jp/articles/shuntaka9576-gh/\u003e\nhubってGitHub非公式だったんか。。","ts":"1618541370.145900","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: github/hub","id":1,"title":"github/hub","title_link":"https://github.com/github/hub","text":"A command-line tool that makes git easier to use with GitHub. - github/hub","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/603039060d7db1aa17d9ea74d5f928a8e03ac48ad22df0fc0674856dd9f8acbb/github/hub","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/github/hub","original_url":"https://github.com/github/hub"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lJuLh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b3f6d4f-5122-4bf9-b858-3a93f5860ee1","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"range-diff ちょっとマニアックだけど便利\n\u003chttps://git-scm.com/docs/git-range-diff#_examples\u003e","ts":"1618552454.148800","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XyxSY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b78904d-1ecb-499d-9afb-be86b15f5d34","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"手で `git diff HEAD..master` 的な範囲の指定できるけど、それよりやりやすそう？","ts":"1618552509.149500","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8DAZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67ead57e-2141-4070-a34b-9a8e6d757952","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"`diff \u0026lt;(git diff x1..x2) \u0026lt;(git diff y1..y2)` 的な機能ですね。\ndiff と diff の diff を見るといいますか","ts":"1618552572.149700","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UJMye"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d4ba88c-d828-4575-904a-1f34d5d49e9e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、なるほどなるほど","ts":"1618552788.149900","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97cde6cf-f608-43a0-8dfc-3a15470a2f54","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"ただ、全体の diff を取ってるわけじゃなくて、コミットごとの diff を取ってるみたいです。\n\n1. 比較対象間の各歴史範囲のうち、各コミットに対応する他方のコミットを紐付ける\n2. 紐付いたコミット間で個別に diff を取る\nというアルゴリズム（ドキュメントに書いてある）\n\nさっきの例だと、「rebase 後に、各コミットごとに差分が発生してないか」をチェックする用途になるかなと","ts":"1618552933.150100","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CmEt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75d1fcd6-3066-46e5-94cf-1891406ea500","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"（自分で言っててわかりづらい）","ts":"1618552957.150300","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1618553052.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zMEoS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e01bbbb-fcc7-48d4-bd21-f52b77b6c322","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"rebaseでコンフリクトしていじりすぎとか検知ですね。\nわかりました、ありがとうございます。","ts":"1618553357.150600","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UPWFF5YQ7"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U4e=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7b5ea8e-8f07-41b2-ba07-d4bf85656d21","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"まさにそれですね","ts":"1618553382.150800","thread_ts":"1618552434.148600","parent_user_id":"UPWFF5YQ7","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qnUM"}]}]
